004 - Praise, My Soul, the King of Heaven
Henry Francis Lyte / John Goss
Key: D
Time: 4/4
Tempo: 100
Number: 4
Topic: Worship - Adoration and Praise

Verse 1:
[D]Praise, my soul, [A7/E]the King [D/F#]of [F#m]heaven;
[D]To [G/B]His [D]feet [G]thy [F#m]tribute [Em]bring;
[A]Ransomed, [F#/A#]healed, [C#dim]restored, [B7/D#]forgiven,
[A]Who [D/F#]like thee [E7]His [A]praise [D/F#]should [F#m]sing?
[G]Praise [A7]Him, [Bm]praise Him, [C#dim]alleluia,
[G]Praise the everlasting [D]King.

Verse 2:
[D]Praise Him for [A7/E]His grace [D/F#]and [F#m]favor
[D]To [G/B]our [D]fathers [F#m]in [Bm]distress;
[A]Praise [F#/A#]Him, still [C#dim]the [Bm/D]same [B7/D#]forever,
[A]Slow [D/F#]to chide [E7]and [A]swift [D/F#]to [F#m]bless;
[G]Praise [A7]Him, [Bm]praise Him, [C#dim]alleluia,
[G]Glorious in [D/A]His faithfulness.

Verse 3:
[D]Tenderly [A7/E]He shields and [D/F#]spares [G]us;
[D]Well [G/B]our [D]feeble [F#m]frame [Bm]He [Em]knows;
[A]In [F#/A#]His hands [C#dim]He [Bm/D]gently [Fdim]bears [F#m]us,
[A]Rescues [D]us [E7]from [A]all [D/F#]our [F#m]foes:
[G]Praise [A7]Him, [Bm]praise Him, [C#dim]alleluia,
[G]Widely as [D/A]His [A7]mercy [D]flows.

Verse 4:
[D]Angels, help [A7/E]us to [D/F#]adore [G]Him:
[D]Ye [G/B]behold Him [F#m]face [Bm]to [Em]face;
[A]Sun [F#/A#]and moon [C#dim]bow [Bm/D]down [B7/D#]before [F#m]Him:
[A]Dwellers [D]all [E7]in [A]time [D/F#]and [F#m]space,
[G]Praise [A7]Him, [Bm]praise Him, [C#dim]alleluia,
[G]Praise with us [D/A]the God [A7]of [D]grace.
